\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.8}{\ignorespaces Information flow of the existing risk-annotated scene graph framework. Adapted from \blx@tocontentsinit {0}\cite {previous_rsg_thesis}.}}{22}{figure.caption.12}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.9}{\ignorespaces Overview of the Segment Anything Model (SAM) architecture. The model consists of an image encoder, a prompt encoder, and a lightweight mask decoder that produces segmentation masks conditioned on input prompts. Reproduced from Kirillov et al.~\blx@tocontentsinit {0}\cite {kirillov2023segmentanything}.}}{26}{figure.caption.13}%
